 mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-athletic font-bold text-[#212529] uppercase tracking-tight mb-6\">About Braik</h1><p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-[#212529]/80 leading-relaxed text-[#212529]/85\">The team operating system for football programs that need structure without another pile of disconnected apps.</p></div></section><section class=\"relative scroll-mt-24 bg-white py-14 md:py-20\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-6 md:space-y-8\"><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">What Braik is</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>Braik is a single place for rosters, schedules, messaging, documents, collections, and football-specific tools like playbooks—so head coaches can run the program instead of chasing fifteen different logins.</p><p><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#212529]\">We ship for football first.</span> Workflows, language, and permissions mirror how varsity staffs, position coaches, players, and families actually interact. Other sports may come later; today we focus on doing football operations exceptionally well.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-xl border p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 border-slate-200/90 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm [&amp;_p]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_li]:text-slate-700 [&amp;_strong]:text-slate-900 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#3B82F6]/35 hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><h3 class=\"font-athletic text-lg uppercase tracking-wide md:text-xl pr-2 mb-4 text-slate-900 font-semibo